    "created": "20260924184744924",
    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>8级 护卫</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>大型 自然界 野兽</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 89；''重伤'' 44</span><span>''先攻'' +8</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 24，''强韧'' 22，''反射'' 19，''意志'' 19</span><span>''侦查'' +6</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 8，攀爬 4</span><span>''感官'' 昏暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}啮咬✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+15 vs. AC<br>命中：2d6+5 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">次要动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">气势汹汹✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>该凶暴虎进行一个移动动作。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">捕猎本能✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>最近的一个敌人被指定为该凶暴虎的猎物直到遭遇结束或直到该凶暴虎指定其他猎物。该凶<br>暴虎的攻击对其猎物造成 1d6 额外伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">触发动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}飞扑✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>触发：当该凶暴虎的猎物在该凶暴虎 5 格内进行快步时。<br>该凶暴虎快步到最近的邻接其猎物的空间并对它进行一次啮咬攻击。在快步期间，该凶暴虎<br>可以移动穿过敌人占据的空间。</div>\n<div class=\"italic bg-flavortext\">（凶暴虎）</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 隐秘+11</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 20（+9）</span><span>''敏捷'' 15（+6）</span><span>''感知'' 15（+6）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 17（+7）</span><span>''智力'' 2（+0）</span><span>''魅力'' 13（+6）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span></div></div>\n</div>",
